{"id":"0dc766857d9e42f4","group":"91","path":"91/91-lem-truth-lemma.md","title":"TB的闭句去引号实例","display":"lem-truth-lemma — TB的闭句去引号实例","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-lem-truth-lemma","aliases":["91-lem-truth-lemma"],"display":"lem-truth-lemma — TB的闭句去引号实例","depends_on":["[[91-df-TB]]","[[91-df-T-schema]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-lem-truth-lemma"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-lem-truth-lemma</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-truth-lemma — TB的闭句去引号实例"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6018cc1b13710826\" href=\"?note=6018cc1b13710826\" title=\"91-df-TB\">91-df-TB</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ba367ff1b4bb3da3\" href=\"?note=ba367ff1b4bb3da3\" title=\"91-df-T-schema\">91-df-T-schema</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"lem-truth-lemma-—-TB-的闭句去引号实例\">lem-truth-lemma — TB 的闭句去引号实例</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TB}\">\\(\\mathrm{TB}\\)</span> (在共同算术基底上加入闭句去引号实例的理论)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TSch}_{\\mathcal L_0}(T)\">\\(\\operatorname{TSch}_{\\mathcal L_0}(T)\\)</span>\n(TB 的真理公理集, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ba367ff1b4bb3da3\" href=\"?note=ba367ff1b4bb3da3\" title=\"91-df-T-schema\">91-df-T-schema</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\)</span> (基础语言句子集)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> (真理谓词)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}truth\\text{-}lemma}\\vdash\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\,\n\\left[\n\\bigl(\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\n\\bigr)\n\\in\n\\operatorname{TSch}_{\\mathcal L_0}(T)\n\\right],\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}truth\\text{-}lemma}\\vdash\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\,\n\\left[\n\\bigl(\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\n\\bigr)\n\\in\n\\operatorname{TSch}_{\\mathcal L_0}(T)\n\\right],\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>从而</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\,\n\\mathrm{TB}\\vdash\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\,\n\\mathrm{TB}\\vdash\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是 TB 定义的直接展开，不是额外的完备性或可靠性定理。它只覆盖\n不含真理谓词的闭基础句；参数的一致处理属于 UTB，复合结构的一致\n递归处理属于组合真理理论。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"lem-truth-lemma-—-TB-的闭句去引号实例","text":"lem-truth-lemma — TB 的闭句去引号实例","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-TB","status":"resolved","id":"6018cc1b13710826","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-TB]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-T-schema","status":"resolved","id":"ba367ff1b4bb3da3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-T-schema]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-T-schema","status":"resolved","id":"ba367ff1b4bb3da3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{TSch}_{\\mathcal L_0}(T)$\n(TB 的真理公理集, see [[91-df-T-schema]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{TB}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TSch}_{\\mathcal L_0}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}truth\\text{-}lemma}\\vdash\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\,\n\\left[\n\\bigl(\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\n\\bigr)\n\\in\n\\operatorname{TSch}_{\\mathcal L_0}(T)\n\\right],","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\,\n\\mathrm{TB}\\vdash\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi.","display":true}],"bytes":1193,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["6018cc1b13710826","ba367ff1b4bb3da3"]}